Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add base path support for running Flowise behind an
 ingress

Enable Flowise to run behind an ingress with a path prefix (e.g., /flowise)
so it can be accessed via URLs like https://example.com/flowise/.

- Add VITE_BASE_PATH env var for UI build (vite base option + React Router basename)
- Add FLOWISE_BASE_PATH env var for server (API routes, static files, admin dashboard)
- Update baseURL in constant.js to include base path for API calls

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
