From 7b7dfef093f8d37a5d413cfe83929189faf2a15f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tianwei-liu <tianwei.liu@workday.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Feb 2026 15:53:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix: Fix base path issues with navigation and redirects

- Use absolute paths in index.html for manifest.json, favicon.ico,
  logo192.png so Vite can transform them with base path
- Remove manual config.basename prepending in NavItem since
  BrowserRouter already handles it (was causing doubled paths)
- Add basePath to server logout redirects in account.controller.ts
- Fix SSO login redirects to include basePath in signIn, register,
  and organization pages
- Fix ErrorContext path comparison to handle base path
- Use navigate() instead of window.location.href in account page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
